cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "vgtfm: vision-guided transcriptomics foundation models"
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code for "Slide-level batch structure limits histology-guided supervision of
  transcriptomic foundation models". Tests whether matched H&E histology, used only
  as a training-time supervisory signal, improves frozen transcriptomic
  foundation-model representations (Geneformer, scGPT, CancerFoundation) of 10x
  Visium spatial transcriptomics, and diagnoses the slide-level batch structure that
  limits cross-modal transfer.
